{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":false,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-electricity-support-comparator UI copy.details","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-electricity-support-comparator.copy.details","keys":["norway-electricity-support-comparator.copy.details"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"El suport de la llar estàndard paga ZXQPH0000QXZ de cada import de preu spot horari per sobre de NOK ZXQPH0001QXZ/ kWh abans de l' IVA, per a un ús elegible fins a ZXQPH0002QXZ kWh per mes. Norgespris usa un preu de referència fix de NOK ZXQPH0003QXZ/ kWh incloent l' IVA (NOK ZXQPH0004QXZ sense l' IVA de l' electricitat); la seva liquidació usa el preu spot mitjà de l' àrea del mes sencer i l' ús mesurat elegible. El límit és ZXQPH0005QXZ kWh/ mes per a una llar o ZXQPH0006QXZ kWh/ mes per a una casa de vacances. Una llar pot triar un esquema, no els dos. Les càrregues de xarxa i altres càrrecs s' introdueixen per separat i s' afegeixen a tots els","record_id":"089287aed772b07acb8118aa1ba84ab26904df400c486f0b9428134842200c1a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.9381832207500054,"source":"The standard household support pays 90% of each hourly spot-price amount above NOK 0.77/kWh before VAT, for eligible use up to 5,000 kWh per month. Norgespris uses a fixed reference price of NOK 0.50/kWh including VAT (NOK 0.40 without electricity VAT); its settlement uses the full month’s area-average spot price and eligible metered use. The cap is 5,000 kWh/month for a home or 1,000 kWh/month for a holiday home. A household can choose one scheme, not both. Network charges and other fees are entered separately and added to all scenarios. The comparison uses the exact hourly data you provide; it does not fetch prices.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d4